# The ASan probe must run whatever `-o` looks like. With a bare output name it
# used to be looked up in PATH ("probe.asan_probe: command not found") and the
# sanitizer was silently dropped. Whether ASan then arms is platform-specific
# (macOS AMFI refuses it), so only the probe-failure line is asserted: absent.
# issues/fixed/sanitize-address-is-silently-dropped-for-a-bare-output-name.md
stdout_keep=asan_probe|command not found
